## Key KPIs

- Total Transactions
- Successful Transactions
- Failed Transactions
- Pending Transactions
- Payment Success Rate
- Payment Failure Rate
- Daily Transaction Volume
- Payment Method Performance
- Channel-wise Failure Rate

*Metric Definition:* Success and failure percentages use resolved transactions (successful + failed) as the denominator. Pending transactions are excluded from these two rates.

